                                "sense_id": "24ecb32a-f0e7-31fe-9f8a-3023b22a7e07",
                                "text": "Towns have been taken, and battles have been won; the mob has huzza'd round bonefires, the Stentor of the chappel has ſtrained his throat in the gallery, and the Stentor of S——m has deafned his audience from the pulpit."
                            },
